@title Four command windows open at once stack in the right strip and each pane keeps a usable height (1366x768)
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
click_text "Open example"
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text standards check
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text electrical inputs
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text wire numbering
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text ask claude
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot four-windows
check_layout
